# --- multimedia: GPU, camera, video, audio
# The display stack stays (FB_MSM_MDSS, MDSS PLL, panel regulators, WLED): the
# bootloader hands over a running splash screen, and without the driver the
# kernel cuts its clocks/rails under it. First boot without it ended in an
# apps watchdog bark (bootreason=watchdog_apps_bark).
# CONFIG_FB_MSM_MDSS_WRITEBACK is not set
# (MDSS also needs the SWITCH class: mdss_mdp_wb.c uses switch_set_state)
# CONFIG_MSM_KGSL is not set
# CONFIG_MEDIA_SUPPORT is not set
# CONFIG_MSM_VIDC_V4L2 is not set
