# Left in on purpose: removing all of DUMMY, TUN, PPP and the USB Ethernet
# adapter drivers (USBNET, CATC, KAWETH, PEGASUS, RTL8150, RTL8152, HSO, IPHETH)
# hangs the boot (apps watchdog bark, found by bisecting with
# scripts/probe-boot.sh). Which one, and why, is not known yet.

